//! event_wait, sleep, shader_cycles, realtime}`). Each line is encoded by the
//! native writer's codec and compared with the dwords `llvm-mc -mcpu=gfx1201
//! -show-encoding` (AMD clang 24.0.0git, ROCm d6f6cb69) prints for it; when
//! that assembler is installed the test also re-runs it and compares live.

